@host = https://localhost:7001

### Liveness and SQL probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Build and module inventory
GET {{host}}/api/v1/system/info

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Background job dashboard - needs platform.jobs.view
GET {{host}}/jobs

# Module request collections live next to each module as it grows an endpoint:
#   src/UPBazaar.Modules.<Name>/UPBazaar.Modules.<Name>.http
